WEBVTT

NOTE
Every line the film says in its own voice, generated from the scene sources.
The film has no spoken dialogue; the audio is music only, so none of this is a
transcript of speech. Labels and figures drawn on the instruments are not
repeated here — they are already on screen.

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.480
Every way to pay is
a separate machine.

2
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.180
Your checkout is still up.
Your success rate moved one point.

3
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:18.110
On that one route,
every second payment
is failing.

4
00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:22.560
They don't retry.
They just leave.

5
00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:35.160
It costs less than you think —
and far more than you're measuring.

6
00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:50.600
of what recovery costs
never reaches an invoice.

7
00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:59.420
It sits beside your checkout.
Never in front of it.

8
00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:25.070
Two hundred and thirty-three where the right answer is nothing at all.

9
00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:47.500
recovered for every rupee spent — and that rupee
already prices every customer it cost.

10
00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:50.800
So what actually happens
to one failed payment?

11
00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:19.990
Five stations.
Not one of them is a language model.

12
00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:22.720
An agent you have to watch
isn't an agent. It's a dashboard.

13
00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:39.500
No approval queue.
An approval queue needs
someone awake.

14
00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:41.790
An AI agent is not a language model
with a to-do list.

15
00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:44.320
The AI in Kairos is the part that
decides which losses are worth chasing.

16
00:02:57.220 --> 00:03:01.620
Four of those are the agent.
The fifth is a tool the agent picks up.

17
00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:12.010
The model is a tool this agent picks up.
It is not the intelligence — and it never runs
while your money is moving.

18
00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:14.250
Greek has two words for time.

19
00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:34.180
Software that spends your money
while you sleep is a promise
you are not awake to keep.

20
00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:38.180
You delegated it.
Your customer never did.

21
00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:42.917
I spent twelve days on the part
that keeps that promise.
